The Guilds of Ask'lan ply more than just arts and crafts -- their clandestine ways offer freedom to traffic forbidden goods, such as poisons, medicines, weapons, tools for preparing the dead and even war golems. Such groups are known as the Amenti -- and you have received news of one such group. You may choose to trade with them, or to take their goods by force.

